  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>4</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>″</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math><br /><br />Put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>″</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>3</mn> </mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>″</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>1</mn> </mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>″</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>0</mn> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is minimum at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> maximum at <math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </math>, neither maximum nor minimum at <math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow> </math>",
